    "demo": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Tabs demo</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n        --bg: #ffffff;\n        --fg: #1a1a1a;\n        --muted: #595959;\n        --accent: #0b57d0;\n      }\n      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n        :root {\n          --bg: #121212;\n          --fg: #f0f0f0;\n          --muted: #b8b8b8;\n          --accent: #8ab4f8;\n        }\n      }\n      body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 2rem 1rem;\n        font:\n          1rem/1.5 system-ui,\n          sans-serif;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n      }\n      main {\n        max-width: 40rem;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      [role=\"tablist\"] {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 0.25rem;\n        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--muted);\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n      }\n      [role=\"tab\"] {\n        font: inherit;\n        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n        border: 0;\n        border-bottom: 4px solid transparent;\n        margin-bottom: -2px;\n        background: none;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        cursor: pointer;\n      }\n      [role=\"tab\"][aria-selected=\"true\"] {\n        color: var(--fg);\n        font-weight: 600;\n        border-bottom-color: var(--accent);\n      }\n      :focus-visible {\n        outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n        outline-offset: 2px;\n      }\n      [role=\"tabpanel\"] {\n        padding: 1rem 0.25rem;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main>\n      <h1>Trail running shoe</h1>\n      <h2 id=\"info-heading\">Product information</h2>\n      <div role=\"tablist\" aria-labelledby=\"info-heading\">\n        <button\n          type=\"button\"\n          role=\"tab\"\n          id=\"tab-details\"\n          aria-selected=\"true\"\n          aria-controls=\"panel-details\"\n        >\n          Details\n        </button>\n        <button\n          type=\"button\"\n          role=\"tab\"\n          id=\"tab-specs\"\n          aria-selected=\"false\"\n          aria-controls=\"panel-specs\"\n          tabindex=\"-1\"\n        >\n          Specs\n        </button>\n        <button\n          type=\"button\"\n          role=\"tab\"\n          id=\"tab-reviews\"\n          aria-selected=\"false\"\n          aria-controls=\"panel-reviews\"\n          tabindex=\"-1\"\n        >\n          Reviews\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div\n        role=\"tabpanel\"\n        id=\"panel-details\"\n        aria-labelledby=\"tab-details\"\n        tabindex=\"0\"\n      >\n        <p>A light shoe with a grippy sole for wet rock and mud.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div\n        role=\"tabpanel\"\n        id=\"panel-specs\"\n        aria-labelledby=\"tab-specs\"\n        tabindex=\"0\"\n        hidden\n      >\n        <p>Weight 280 g. Drop 6 mm. Lug depth 5 mm.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div\n        role=\"tabpanel\"\n        id=\"panel-reviews\"\n        aria-labelledby=\"tab-reviews\"\n        tabindex=\"0\"\n        hidden\n      >\n        <p>4.6 out of 5 from 212 reviews.</p>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n    <script>\n      const tabs = [...document.querySelectorAll('[role=\"tab\"]')];\n      function select(tab) {\n        for (const other of tabs) {\n          const selected = other === tab;\n          other.setAttribute(\"aria-selected\", String(selected));\n          other.tabIndex = selected ? 0 : -1;\n          document.getElementById(other.getAttribute(\"aria-controls\")).hidden =\n            !selected;\n        }\n        tab.focus();\n      }\n      for (const tab of tabs) {\n        tab.addEventListener(\"click\", () => select(tab));\n        tab.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (e) => {\n          const i = tabs.indexOf(tab);\n          const target = {\n            ArrowRight: i + 1,\n            ArrowLeft: i - 1,\n            Home: 0,\n            End: -1,\n          }[e.key];\n          if (target === undefined) return;\n          e.preventDefault();\n          select(tabs.at(target % tabs.length));\n        });\n      }\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
    "description": "Build accessible tabs with tablist, tab and tabpanel roles, roving tabindex and arrow key navigation",
    "expectations": "# Expectations: tabs\n\n1. The tabs sit in an element with role `tablist` that has an accessible name; each tab has role `tab`.\n2. Exactly one tab has `aria-selected=\"true\"`, and only that tab has `tabindex=\"0\"`; the others have `tabindex=\"-1\"`.\n3. With focus on the selected tab, pressing Arrow Right moves focus to the next tab; on the last tab it wraps to the first.\n4. Pressing Home focuses the first tab and End focuses the last.\n5. Each visible panel has role `tabpanel` and its accessible name equals the selected tab's name; panels of unselected tabs are not visible.\n6. Pressing Tab from the selected tab moves focus into or onto the visible panel, never to another tab.\n",
